<code>

input_variable <variable>,<question>[,answer][,escape]

</code>
'''Parameters'''

* <code>question</code>: 
The question the player needs to reply (e.g. "access_code").
* <code>Then you create the msgid "access_code" inside the PO file</code>: 

msgid "access_code"
msgstr "Here the actual question?"

